{"title":"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f413c3ff7486b8b8d2ffb0d371589a265758c2ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"22\" height=\"19\" /> to be the sum of the positive factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\nFor example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d4b83523fc9665d566cf0d543dc24aa33d03ee3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6} = 1 + 2 + 3 + 6 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"23\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e381e483e21566ebdac68e08350f41506cd57fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\boxed{11}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"41\" height=\"35\" /> .\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80ed0fa4c04ae35ac5b24ee0dea2f67789bcebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 13 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 28 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/a/0ca5bfc2d2eb71d5914255985f56b168d2a74e31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\boxed{\\boxed{11}}&amp;=\\boxed{1+11} \\\\ &amp;=\\boxed{12} \\\\ &amp;=1+2+3+4+6+12 \\\\ &amp;=28, \\end{align*}\" width=\"239\" height=\"112\" />\nfrom which the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073fd252003bd86beb4a5c56abab492448505971.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 28}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Aplus95 (Fundamental Logic)\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM (Reconstruction)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ih8lEBwPqEY\">https://youtu.be/Ih8lEBwPqEY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omFpSGMWhFc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omFpSGMWhFc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8\">2007 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>